                Worked example: equipment of a 40-foot chemistry-laboratory container
              </h2>

              <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl p-8 my-8 not-prose">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-primary text-lg mb-4">Project profile</h4>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-sm">
