              <!-- KAPITEL 12: CHECKLISTE -->
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3" id="checkliste">
                <span class="bg-primary text-slate-900 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold shrink-0">12</span>
                The complete equipment checklist
              </h2>

              <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                You can use this checklist directly for planning your laboratory-container project. It covers all seven equipment areas:
              </p>

              <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 my-8 not-prose">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 text-lg">Planning checklist: laboratory-container equipment</h4>
                <div class="space-y-6">
                  <div>
                    <h5 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Laboratory furniture</h5>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Workbenches: number, length and worktop material defined</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Fume cupboards: number, type and dimensions determined</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Cabinet systems: wall, under-bench and safety cabinets planned</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Load capacity of workbenches checked for planned instruments</span></label>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h5 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Media supply</h5>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Water quality defined (drinking water, deionised, ultrapure)</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Waste-water treatment clarified (neutralisation, indirect discharge)</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Gas types and number of connections defined (N₂, He, Ar, compressed air)</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Vacuum supply: central or decentralised?</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Gas-cylinder storage outside the container planned</span></label>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h5 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Safety</h5>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Emergency shower (DIN EN 15154-1) – location defined</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Eyewash (DIN EN 15154-2) – at every sink</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Fire extinguisher – type and location determined</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Emergency-stop switch for power and gas planned in</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Safety cabinets: F90, acid–alkali, compressed gas – number defined</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>PPE storage planned in</span></label>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h5 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Floors &amp; walls</h5>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Floor covering chosen to match the chemical class</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>ESD capability checked (for electronics work)</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Wall lining: fire class B-s1, d0 met</span></label>
                      <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 accent-[#bbd700]" /><span>Coved skirting planned in for cleanroom/GMP</span></label>
